 "remarks": "Chic Rental Convenient to All Darien Offers | Enjoy comfortable living in this inviting Darien Cape featuring a renovated, chic eat-in kitchen with stainless steel appliances opening to the dining room. The welcoming living room features a wood-burning fireplace, while beautiful hardwood floors extend into the main-level primary bedroom and additional home office. A full bath with tub/shower completes the first floor. Upstairs, two versatile rooms feature wall-to-wall carpeting and bath with shower. A delightful four-season sunroom off the kitchen offers additional year-round living space, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The full, dry basement with French drains provides ample storage and laundry facilities. A detached two-car garage adds convenience.  Outside, enjoy a level, tranquil backyard ideal for summer barbecues, outdoor games, entertaining, or simply unwinding in a peaceful setting.  Available for a 1-2 year lease. Pets considered-please inquire.",
